Rhaglen rheoli-cof: 0.

>> a := -2 gwerth-absoliwt.
a := a atan.
a := a cos.
a := a log.
a := a sin.
a := a tan.


Rhaglen tacluso.

usedMemory1 := (Rhaglen cof ? 0).


